cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PosteriFlow, please cite it as below."
title: "PosteriFlow: Calibrated Neural Posterior Estimation for Overlapping Gravitational-Wave Signals"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Thomas
    given-names: Bibin
    email: bibinthomas951@gmail.com
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-31
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/bibinthomas123/PosteriFlow"
abstract: >-
  Amortized neural posterior estimation for compact-binary coalescences in
  whitened H1/L1/V1 strain. One forward pass returns the posterior over 11
  source parameters of the k-th loudest signal, handling time-overlapping
  signals through rank conditioning, with calibration-gated model selection
  and real-detector-noise training.
keywords:
  - gravitational waves
  - simulation-based inference
  - neural posterior estimation
  - normalizing flows
  - overlapping signals
